WEBVTT

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:09.880
"Xianyang"

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:13.630
Ha-Hangu Pass is in flames?!

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:14.680
Yes!

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.060
Any signal fires saying that it's fallen?

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.980
Th-That remains unconfirmed!

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:28.770
But given the flames,
it's just a matter of time.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:31.990
Hangu Pass won't fall that easily.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:36.280
It's only <i>truly </i>fallen once
its lower gate has been opened.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.620
We've blocked off the
main gate with boulders.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:45.000
The enemy will have to clear the wall
and open the gate from inside.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.090
And since a large army is unlikely
to reach the top in one fell swoop,

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:54.550
our reserves stationed below
should be sufficient to repel them.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:58.600
There <i>is </i>one situation in which
those defenses could be breached:

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:04.560
If the enemy came over the mountains
from the battlefields on either side.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.860
How are the other battlefields faring?

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.820
Yes, sire. To the right,
facing Hangu Pass,

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.360
where Meng Wu's and Teng's
allied army is fighting Chu,

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.410
the battle continues
to hang in the balance.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:23.870
The same further right: though small
in number, Lord Biao's army

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:27.880
is fighting fiercely and holding
its own against the Zhao army.

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.420
Excellent!

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.050
Despite the inevitable
struggle on both battlefields,

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.210
they're handling it splendidly!

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:36.010
And the left battlefield?

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.720
How fares Wang Jian's army against Yan's?

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.050
Well...

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.600
Y-You see, sire...

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:48.400
Well? Out with it!

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.900
H-Hangu Pass is on fire?!

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.570
Shh! Not so loud, Xiang!

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:02.200
Does... does that mean
Hangu Pass has fallen?

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.620
I don't know.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:07.620
But things are much more precarious--
that much is certain.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.920
Wh-What do we do now, Yang?

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.760
We must consider the absolute
worst that could happen.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.760
The absolute worst?

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:23.140
If enemy troops really do start
pouring into the Inner Palace here...

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.930
...the person who's bound
to have the hardest time

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:31.060
might be you, Xiang--
carrying His Highness's child.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.810
Me... and...

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:34.940
...and this child...

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.530
I'm scared.

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:38.820
I'm just so scared...

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.360
Your Highness...

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.200
Xiang!

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.080
Get it together!

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:51.750
All we can do is prepare for the worst--
as women in a warring state do.

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:55.920
We'll ready ourselves the best we can.
Then all that's left...

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.340
is to pray for the men's victory.

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:07.140
O heavens... may the Qin
army be victorious.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.440
"The Wa Lin Army's Charge"

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.690
What?!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:46.240
You've lost track of the
Wang Jian Army's battle status?

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.570
What is the meaning of this?!

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.700
Well, ah, the thing is...

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:53.080
The Wang Jian Army itself
seems to have vanished.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.000
It did <i>what</i>?!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.460
It can't be!

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:01.380
Surely they didn't <i>run away</i>.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.800
It's not unthinkable.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.720
--What?!
--But isn't that...

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.510
What on earth...

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:08.470
Wang Jian...

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:11.470
As the head of Wang Yi's
illustrious family,

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:15.390
he was rumored to be as
talented as Wang Yi himself.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:21.230
But his dangerous ideas kept
him out of King Zhao's favor.

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.400
What dangerous ideas?

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:27.910
Wang Jian has neither love for
his country nor a sense of loyalty.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.530
You see...

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:34.080
It's said that he has ambitions
of becoming king himself.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.380
You imbeciles.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:44.210
Whyever would you assign a man
like that to such a crucial post?

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:50.800
To think Wang Jian would
actually up and run away!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.390
"Two Hours Earlier"

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.020
Report!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:01.520
The Khaoto have infiltrated one
of the forts on the right!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.980
Report! The Pakoh have been wiped out!

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.280
The Saca Hala are struggling in the front!

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.610
The Zhitmit have taken the left-hand fort!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.530
Wu Lu Duo, sir...

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.240
Good one!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.870
Well, Yu Qi Wei?

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.920
How's Wang Jian? Tough?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.540
I'll say.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:24.090
The way he works the mountains,
it's hard to believe he's a flatlander.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:28.010
That Zhai tribe was wiped out
right before my eyes.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.640
I see.

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:33.810
And how is our main offensive
unit coming along?

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.600
The second northern fort
is requesting reinforcements!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.520
Send in 2,000!

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:44.020
The first forts in the west and
south are under heavy attack!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.940
Give them 3,000 each!

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.030
"Qin"

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:51.280
For as quiet as it is here,
the other forts have it really rough.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:52.160
Yeah.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.990
Fort defense has never
been such a struggle.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:55.990
Hmm?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:00.790
What the--?!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:01.790
Enemy--

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:04.800
Enemy attack!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.930
We've lost our central fort?!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.510
But how? It was supposed
to be tight as a drum!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:20.810
With that gone, all the forts
will be cut off--isolated!

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.940
Wang Jian, sir!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:27.730
We must place a new network
of units, and quickly!

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:29.240
No.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.490
We withdraw.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.950
Report!

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.040
Just as suspected, they're all empty!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.370
"Yan"

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.710
When he runs away,
he certainly is thorough about it.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:48.800
Imagine leaving all these forts behind!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:49.800
Wu Lu Duo!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.010
Hmm? Ah, Wu Ta Ci!

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:55.350
Where has Wang Jian's army gone?

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:58.430
They ran off to the northwest,
moving so quickly

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.850
I nearly lost sight of them!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.730
The northwest?

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:07.770
He must really be set on tossing
this war by the wayside.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:15.490
He's just as Li Mu said:

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:18.790
The man won't fight a battle he can't win.

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:23.920
Which only means he was never
cut out for this war in the first place.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.000
General!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.880
The Yan troops at the rear
are lagging behind!

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:30.460
Makes sense, given the perilous path.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.470
Flatlanders <i>would </i>find it challenging.

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:34.930
I don't care!

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:38.260
Tell them to follow along
at their own pace.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:42.430
I'll be going on ahead
with our muscle here.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.310
There's no one left to stand in our way.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.650
No need to wait up for the others, either!

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.440
Once we've crossed this pass,
it'll all open up--

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.150
and there before us...

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:58.950
A massive cliff bridge,
taking us beyond Hangu Pass!

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.660
Well played.

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:06.790
I've never seen anyone read
the mountains so accurately.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:11.630
As expected of the man who became
king of fifty northern mountain tribes,

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.840
even though he's a flatlander.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:20.560
Only by blood. I was born
and raised in the mountains.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.810
I can look at any mountain before me

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:27.560
and perceive how the craggy
terrain unfolds behind it.

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.820
No wonder he had no trouble zeroing in
on the heart of Wang Jian's army

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.730
and crushing it flat.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:47.170
Once we ascend that cliff
and follow that ridge,

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:50.540
we can flood onto the
far side of Hangu Pass!

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.710
And remember:

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:55.050
There is no wall we cannot climb!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:58.470
Onward, my compatriots!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:09.150
This war is as good as won.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.730
Keep going! Don't let the
other tribes get there first!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:15.820
Show 'em the sheer might of our people!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:32.920
They got the jump on me--
here, in the mountains?!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.340
Wu Lu Duo, sir!
Enemy troops, right behind us!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.670
Please--run!

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.640
Shieldsmen! Keep Wu Lu Duo safe!

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.140
This is absurd--impossible!

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:46.310
Wang Jian fled to the northwest--
he can't be here.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.980
Even if that's a detached unit,

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:51.730
there's no way my pursuit
corps wouldn't have noticed

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.940
so many troops moving!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.110
How in blazes...

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:58.030
Wu Lu Duo, sir! Hurry!

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:00.910
They <i>didn't </i>move.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:03.910
They've been lying here
in wait this whole time--

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.370
since the fighting began!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.580
Damn you, Wang Jian...

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:12.500
You've been pulling my strings all along!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.960
What a fool.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:15.960
Meng Zhi.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.800
Sir!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:20.130
Fire your arrows with no thought
of your ammo stock.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.640
The enemy is a ragtag
bunch of mountain clans.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:26.520
They are already without leadership,
and they need time to retreat.

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.230
Now's the time to fire on them.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:29.270
Yes, sir!

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:30.190
Meng Long.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.100
Sir!

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.360
That there is Wu Lu Duo.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:36.020
Capture him alive and bring him to me.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.030
Understood.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.900
Let's join up with the main camp--quickly!

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:44.990
Curses. Our being so far from
the main camp has backfired.

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:48.290
Those 8,000 are nearly done for.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.920
Eight thousand troops,
the elite of the mountain tribes...

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:56.550
To be without them in a mountain attack

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:59.170
is an incalculable loss.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.170
Oh!

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:03.340
--Yes!
--Enemy attack!

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.310
Meng Long!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.430
I'm not <i>that </i>stupid.

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.230
They're firing back at us!

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.190
Fire!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.690
Tch. Let's go!

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.240
Meng Long has been shot dead.

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.450
Wu Lu Duo seems to have escaped.

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:26.490
However,

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.240
the 8,000 elite enemy
troops cornered here, well...

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.000
You see what became of them.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.580
This will be a huge blow to the Yan army.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.880
The Yan army retreated even further,

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:45.800
falling back to Wang Jian's
empty forts to regroup.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.510
Wang Jian's vanished <i>again</i>?!

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:52.230
Even we don't know where he's gone.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:56.900
We have no choice.
We'll regroup here, in these forts.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:13:03.030
At least Wang Jian's army
can't touch us here.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:07.320
For one brief moment, the Yan army had
reached the far side of Hangu Pass,

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:12.040
but as it turned out, they would be
stuck here for many long hours.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.130
Li Mu.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:30.470
Your oh-so-critical day 15
is now half over.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:35.270
Hangu Pass still hasn't fallen.

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:40.400
Opening the main gate spells
annihilation for the kingdom of Qin.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.740
They'll only be more desperate now.

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:46.360
In order to quell them <i>and </i>their vigor,

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:48.530
we members of the coalition army

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:51.490
need our morale to be
even higher than theirs.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.370
Morale, eh?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:58.540
In that sense, too, what is
of the utmost importance...

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:02.920
A fierce battle raged on in the
battlefield to the right of Hangu Pass.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.630
"Chu" "Meng"

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:06.130
"Qin"

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:09.510
Center! Assist the left army!

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:15.980
And on the left-hand battlefield, too...

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.650
"Chu"

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.690
That's enough! Withdraw!

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:26.900
They're getting in the way
of our attacks! Kill them!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.610
Enemies--from behind!

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.620
Uh-oh!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:33.950
General Teng!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.960
Go change out your horses, at least.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:39.000
I'll take over for a while.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.540
There he is.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:44.300
Isn't that Teng of Qin,
the general who slayed that old baldy?

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:47.880
The defense over there has
its hands full with that cavalry

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.050
circling them like flies.

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:52.050
Xiang Yi, was it?

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:54.180
I'll give you 5,000 troops.

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:54.930
Huh?!

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:57.680
Charge on in there with
your eyes on the prize.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:00.350
Five thousand... for <i>me</i>?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:05.070
You're the most promising
one in Baldy's first army.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:08.280
Time for this brat to prove he's a man.

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:12.990
And if you <i>do </i>get Teng's head,
I'll reward you with a night in my bed.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.540
N-No, uh, that's quite all right.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.500
However...

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.540
I'll take those 5,000--and gladly!

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:24.340
Watch me, Lord Linwu.
Watch as I avenge you!

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:28.050
Look at him, all fired up.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.800
Now let's see...

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:33.430
Time to put in an appearance
myself for once.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:34.560
Wa Lin, ma'am!

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:52.410
All these troops... they all belong to <i>me</i>!

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:58.370
Your target is the enemy general Teng!
Avenge Lord Linwu!

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.040
Let's go!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.710
Amazing!

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.550
That Xiang Yi really did just move out

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:09.420
with 5,000 troops in his command!

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.630
It's too soon.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.880
Huh?

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.680
I'm the one who best
recognizes Yi's great talent.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:19.680
There's no doubt he'll
become a general one day.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.390
But it's too soon for him
to command 5,000!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:27.440
And it was all so hasty,
they'll never function well as an army.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.900
What does Wa Lin have up her sleeve?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.990
New troops from the right!

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:38.040
From 3,000... to five--
headed right this way!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:40.450
Their morale is sky-high!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.370
I see him! That's Teng!

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:45.170
No bunching up!
Spread out the best you can!

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:46.540
And make it snappy!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.880
They broke formation?!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.130
They've spread out!

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:55.180
Are they trying to surround us?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.970
Those morons.

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:00.060
Spreading themselves thin to take <i>us </i>on?

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:02.350
They misjudged our capability.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.520
We'll break through in a single blow!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.230
I'm the Chu Thunderclap:

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.230
Xiang Yi, commander of 5,000!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:12.150
C'mon, General Teng of Qin--let's play!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.530
Their general gave away his own position!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.370
Teng, sir?

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.200
No.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.910
Right. He's simply trying to entice you.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.120
As much as I'd like to evade them,

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.370
it could be dicey with them
heading for the defensive unit.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.000
Besides...

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.130
I wouldn't mind a 5,000-man
commander's head.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.880
Exactly right! Charge!

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:37.090
Xiang Yi! They're here!

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.470
All right!

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:43.350
No way can this thrown-together
unit of 5,000 fight like an army.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:48.270
All they gotta do is reel
you in with my head as bait.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.110
Then I'll kill you myself!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.230
You don't have to go out there, sir!

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.150
What?!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:55.570
Are there a lot of dumb
generals in Chu or what?

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.110
Moye!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:07.330
Tch!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:11.170
Th-That brat!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.300
This is bad! We're surrounded!

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:15.170
Nicely done, Xiang Yi!

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.220
Get Teng!

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:18.890
Keep Teng safe!

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:19.760
Why, you--

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.850
Outta my way, dumbass!

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.270
Where's Teng?

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.390
You want to duel?

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:25.600
Hell, no!

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:30.310
We surround him and take him out together!

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:33.940
Wow! Xiang Yi actually
managed to stop Teng!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:37.150
The scattered 5,000 spotted
Teng and gathered around him!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.030
At this rate,
they might actually kill him!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:43.330
Yi... are you...

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:46.210
Breaktime's over. Move out!

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:48.120
Wait, Meng Tian, sir!

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.000
We only just changed horses.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.380
Can't we at least wait until the
lieutenant returns from commanding

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:53.340
the right?

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.920
We can't afford to wait!

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:58.180
If General Teng is slain out there,
this place is done for!

00:18:58.180 --> 00:18:59.380
Clear a pa--

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:04.930
"Wa"

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.640
It's General Wa Lin!

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:09.440
General Wa Lin is on the move!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:12.060
Wa Lin herself, coming to the front?

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:15.440
Was she waiting for Teng to jump at Yi?

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:17.950
But making such a production out of it

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.110
might make the stubborn Teng
run back to camp.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:25.240
It's Wa Lin! Wa Lin of the second
army seems to have come forward!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.040
I couldn't have asked for more.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.870
Fall back a moment and find
a way to fire on Wa Lin!

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:30.830
Sir!

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.290
You ain't going nowhere!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.590
Wa Lin, ma'am!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:40.010
I think Teng might get away if
you don't mobilize the cavalry!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.010
Shut it, dimwit.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:47.720
Xiang Yi is over there working his tail
off so he can sleep with me tonight.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:49.180
Don't get in his way.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:52.980
Huh? Then what do <i>we </i>do?

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.900
Us?

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:59.700
<i>We </i>are going to smash the front
of that square formation wide open.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.570
Long Guo, sir! Wa Lin's main
army is headed this way!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.780
What?!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:06.030
So Wa Lin's come for the Long Guo Army,

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:08.450
the very linchpin of
this square formation.

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:11.540
Ba Miu!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.130
Begin!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.500
Here they come!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:15.380
Go!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.710
Onward!

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:17.840
They're coming!

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.260
Stop them!

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.180
The enemy has reached the third wall!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.970
Yu Mao's been killed!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:29.730
Move any and all reserves to the rear!

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:34.480
If they make it past us,
this formation will collapse!

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:36.150
They're tough.

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:41.110
Not fast by any means, yet they're
steadily pushing onward in tidy ranks.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:46.580
They must be pretty confident if they're
not fighting on momentum alone.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:53.120
But this crisis is <i>also </i>the chance of
a lifetime to kill the Chu general Wa Lin.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.000
Tai Wu! Where are you?

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.130
"Teng"

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.130
Here!

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:01.510
Pull up beside Wa Lin's army
and charge from the left!

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.220
We may be facing elite enemy troops,

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:08.600
but your mighty unit was once
the pride of the Wang Yi Army!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.350
Now bring me Wa Lin's head!

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:12.350
Yes, sir!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.230
"Xiang Yi Army"
"Teng Army"

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:17.980
Dammit! These guys don't
know when to quit!

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.440
W-We just need to...

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:23.450
...slay the 5,000-man commander
brat who's dogging Teng!

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:24.450
Yeah!

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.830
This is for Lord Linwu!

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:41.840
Tai Wu Squad, charge!

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:47.340
These bastards...

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:49.720
Just how tight are their defenses?

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:58.020
Ridiculous... How can the Tai Wu Squad
get not even a single step in?!

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:03.780
So this...
This is Wa Lin's elite unit!

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:06.360
Damn, I am sweltering in all this armor.

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:14.500
Bai Li Squad, support Wa Lin's
army on the right!

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:15.910
Don't hit any allies!

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:21.340
Long Guo, sir, it appears
Tai Wu's charge has failed.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:23.670
His unit is under attack!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.800
Have them pull back for now.

00:22:25.800 --> 00:22:26.800
Yes, sir!

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:28.840
Wa Lin's army continues to advance!

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:31.350
We have too few troops in reserve!

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:32.890
Th-This is bad news.

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:38.230
Wa Lin's main army...

00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:41.440
The formation is as good as done for!

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:43.900
I'm taking the reserves
to provide some backup.

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:45.690
You've got this!

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:46.570
Huh?!

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:49.110
B-But we've got our hands full as it is!

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:51.030
Taking our reserves will leave holes!

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:52.990
A few holes are unavoidable!

00:22:52.990 --> 00:22:55.250
Send for reserves from the left flank!

00:22:55.250 --> 00:22:57.040
If they breach the front,

00:22:57.040 --> 00:22:58.790
this whole thing will fall apart!

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:01.460
Hao De.

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:02.710
Yes?

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:04.710
Behind you.

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:07.220
Tch!

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:09.340
Wha--

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:10.680
What's <i>that</i>?!

00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:11.890
Eh?

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:14.100
Enemies? From behind?!

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:57.700
Next time, on <i>Kingdom</i>: "The Strongest."
